{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>《Find Space》是一款以空間配置與規則推理為核心的益智解謎遊戲，適合喜歡《數獨》或 N-Queens 類挑戰、享受純邏輯思考的玩家。目前<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $2.99。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-163.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>三規則空間解謎</h2>\n<p>玩法要求玩家把英雄與生物放進方格，每個顏色領地只能容納一名角色，角色之間不可上下、左右或斜向相鄰，每行每列亦只能各有一個角色。關卡由小型棋盤逐步擴展至大型戰場，全部以純邏輯推理破解，無須隨機猜測；配合經典奇幻地圖風格，可按自己的節奏專注挑戰。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-136-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-137-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-138-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-139-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Find Space – Define Boundary</li><li>應用類別：Entertainment</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/find-space-define-boundary/id6797701448?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T05:43:51.732701+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":290,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T05:30:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T06:17:24.280725+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T05:37:23.011165+00:00","content_hash":"c2e3a9f40393b2da3068bacaf087823e4d4f0b52097c14b55347579bf9d34bcd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}